# Official TOC: consecutive numbering

公文 markers (`一、` / `（一）` / `1.` / `附件N` / `表N`) are consecutive. If the sidebar shows `2.` and `3.` without `1.`, or `一、二、四、` without `三、`, assume something was dropped. Do not treat the jump as normal. Exception: a GB 问答 `1.` thread that continues under `二、` as `2.` is not a hole (see 16).

Attachment forms (`表一` … `表九`) sit under `附件N` and above body `一、`. A restart of `一、` after `二、` inside the same appendix is a new table until `表N` is found.

## When a TOC dump skips a number

List kept markers in order. A hole in one schema (`ArabicDot` 2,3 without 1; dunhao 一、二、四) is a dropped line until proven otherwise. Search scan lines for that marker before changing nest rank or inventing a title.

1. **Salvage** the real line (`SalvageOfficialDunhaoFromLines`, `SalvageSequenceGaps`). After body `一、二、三、四`, `附件：1.标题` is attachment item 1, not 函封面 junk.
2. **Do not invent** a heading from a wrapped idiom: `举一反` + `三、逐一解决；` is 举一反三, not `三、`. `多报合` + `一、信息共享”` is 多报合一 (`ShouldMergeFalseYiDunhaoWrap`). `二、实，回归备案…` is wrapped `之实，`, not a title (`LooksLikeDunhaoBodyRun`). Page-top wrap `财政局、赣江新区…还应报送` / leftover `请各` is the previous `（一）` paragraph (`LooksLikeOfficialOutlineWrapBody`); do not keep it, and do not mash it onto `（一）`. Cap `（一）…年报，请各` at 年报 (`StripGluedBodyAfterHeading` / `TrimTitleToFirstSentence`).
3. **Re-nest** following `2.` `3.` `4.` as `附件2/3/4` siblings of `四、`, not children of `（四）`.
4. Keep dropping cover-letter junk: page-1 `附件：1.` / `2.有关单位名单` **before** `一、`.
5. OCR `附件！` / `附件!` is digit `1` (`RewriteOcrAppendixBang`). Always rewrite to `附件1` before nest or salvage. OCR `二｀政策措施` is `二、` (`RewriteOcrGraveAsDunhao`); do not salvage the hole with a table 序号 row (`37 加强土地保障`).
6. Body `附件：1.` list and later real `附件N` headings are the same items **within one 办法**. Merge by number (`MergeOfficialDuplicateAppendices`): one node per N, dest = later page, keep real title unless it is numbering-only. `附件 2` (space before the digit) is `附件2`, not `附件1`. Cover-list `附件1 某某` plus a later large `某某` is the same item (`MergeOfficialCoverAppendixWithRealHeading`): keep the large heading dest, prefix `附件N`. Do not merge `年度考核登记表` with later `年度考核登记表填写规范`. Do not remap `附件1` dest onto `…填写规范`. Glue bare `附件2` + large `…填写规范`. `附件 2` (space before the digit) is `附件2`. Drop wrap leftovers of the 函 title (`征求〈…要点`, `LooksLikeOfficialCoverTitleFragment`). Unnumbered 函末 `附件：报名表` is a cite (`LooksLikeOfficialUnnumberedAppendixColonCite`), not a start — keep the later real `附件` / `附件1` heading and do not invent `附件2` with the same name. A later 办法’s `附件N` is a new item (`OfficialDocBoundaryBetweenPreorder` on `第一章` / 办法 title). Do not copy the last 函末 list title onto an earlier doc’s 附件 (`OfficialAttachManifestNameAt` uses the list on or before that page). Form footer `附件与本表同时归档)` is a citation, not `附件1`.
7. `第N条` 管理办法/规章 often has a full paragraph on the heading line. Cap the title (`CapNumberedHeadingTitle`); do not drop it for `headingMaxGlyphs`. A chapter with `第二条` and no `第一条` is a dropped article.

8. Two-digit `1.` list numbers often wrap as a lone tens digit plus the units line (`1` then `0.无正当理由…` → `10.…`). Glue with `ShouldGlueSplitListNumber` / `LineStartsWithWrappedListDigitThenTitle`. Do not keep `0.` as a heading.
9. Bare `附表` is the form itself (`FormTable`). Keep it (glue the following 申请表 title). `图N` / `填表说明` numbered notes (`6.配置域名后`) are not headings. Body `（填写附表二）` wrap (`填写` + `附表二）` / `表三）`) is a citation, not `表N` (`ShouldMergeOfficialFillFormWrap`); do not nest later `三、` `四、` under it. Body wrap `附件2)。` / `附件2）` (`LooksLikeOfficialAppendixCiteFragment`) is the same: not an 附件 start, and must not remap the later real `附件2` dest onto that cite. Form-page `附件与本表同时归档)` is also a cite, not `附件1 与本表`. Glue `2.填报…（见` + next-page `附件2)。` (`ShouldMergeOfficialSeeAppendixWrap`). Do not drop body `1.报送《…》（见附件1）` as a duplicate of later `附件1` — a hole `2.` without `1.` is a dropped task line. Cap mashed form fields after `表` (`性别` / `姓名` / `出生年月`) (`TrimMashedOfficialAttachName`); do not cut `登记表填写规范`. Bare `附件4` plus large `…任务分工表` is the sheet name; table row `1 对照全国数据共享清单` (序号 + first cell, even if it ends with 清单) is not (`OfficialNameStartsWithTableSerial`). First-column wrap `一、实现人社数` / mashed `四、增强全国-29` is a table cell (`OfficialDunhaoLooksLikeTableColumnCell`), not the 附件 outline. Scan footer `0—` / `60—` is a page number.
10. Deduction-table scores (`0.1分` / `0.1 应接尽接`) and mashed headers (`序号」单位|扣分`) are not `1.1` sections. A printed TOC that only has 附件 plus last-page junk should Infer the 附件2 `一、` / `1.` `2.` `3.` spine. Body `2、设区市负担…万元。` on the same page as `附件1` is still the 报告 `1、`/`2、` spine — a trailing `。` does not make it a form cell (`LooksLikeOfficialListHeadingTitle`, `OfficialAttachShouldDropHeading`).
11. `附件N` after the last `第N章` / `附则` is a sibling of the chapters, not a child of 附则. `RelayoutOfficialArabicListLevels` pulls Appendix up to the Chapter band. Do not give Appendix a deeper schema slot than Chapter just to keep DP transitions happy. After `附件N`, a restart of `一、` (怎么看 / 工作目标) nests under that 附件, not as its sibling; `表N` still sits between `附件N` and body `一、`. After `附件一` + 办法 title, `第N章` nests under that 附件 (do not leave `第一章` as a sibling of the covering `通知` so merge can fold 规章 onto a later form `附件1`).
12. 函末 `7.申请表` is the same item as later `附件7`. Drop the Arabic-dot index (`DropOfficialArabicDotDuplicateAppendices`, `OfficialAttachIsCoverIndexNode`) only when the rest looks like an attachment name (`申请表` / `说明函` / `一览表` / `OfficialNameLooksLikeAttachmentIndex`) or the body names match. Do not drop report `2、设区市负担…万元` just because later `附件2` exists and the list sits on the same page.

13. CID / missing-ToUnicode 规划正文 (`薈…`, `❢` leaders, `ㆅ㈦ㆆ`) is not a text layer. `ScanLinesLookLikeCidFontGarbage` OCR the front printed 目录; do not keep the 函 wrap `"十四五”规划》的通知` as the only bookmark. A 公文 page can still have `一、` / `（二）` / `1.` while the title rest is wrong Han (`人汴` / `通亦` / `部11`); do not treat the marker as a good text layer (`OfficialHeadingRestLooksLikeCidMash`).

14. Ten 民生实事 实施方案 reuse `一、工作目标` / `二、实施内容` / `三、实施步骤` / `四、资金安排`. `三、实施步骤` near the top of later pages is the outline, not a running header (`OfficialAttachLineIsOutlineSpine`). Do not drop it so the sidebar jumps `二、` → `四、`. A restart of `一、` after `四、` is the next 实施方案.

15. Parent folder `监理合同相关材料` is not a 施工合同. Basename `回复意见` / `函` / `通知` / `请示` (`FileNameHasOfficialKind`) wins over path `合同`. A 回复意见 with consecutive `1.` `2.` `3.` is Official outline, not `LooksLikeContractBodyClause`. Title suffix `回复意见` is a 公文 (`OfficialHanComplete`).

16. GB 问答/条款: `一、` may skip `（一）` and take `1.` directly. The `1.` `2.` `3.` thread may continue under `二、` `三、` (`2.` after `一、`’s last item, `7.` under `三、`) instead of restarting at `1.`. A 通知 in the same file may mix both shapes: `一、` then `1.` (no `（一）`), and `三、` then `（一）`/`（二）` then `1.` — each `（一）` restarts `1.` (`parenSince` in `KeepOfficialArabicListSpine`; do not reset lastKept on `ChineseParen` so GB 问答 `2.` after `1.` stays `consec`). `1.12333电话` is list `1.` plus a phone/ID, not dotted `1.1` (`ParseHeadingNumbering` / `RelayoutOfficialArabicListLevels` must not reset `lParen`). Do not reset ArabicDot `CollectSequenceGaps` on `ChineseDunhao` or `ChineseParen` (`（一）` under `1.` is a child, not a new `1.` list). Glue a wrapped `1.` / `2.` that ends with `、` / `，` or mid-word (`ShouldMergeOfficialArabicDotTitleWrap`); do not drop a complete `？` question as `TitleNeedsWrapContinuation`. `TrimTitleToFirstSentence` must not cut `1.为贯彻落实…，各地应…哪些？` at the clause comma (treat `？` as sentence end). `StripGluedBodyAfterHeading` must not treat `各地` as glued `各` body. After trim, do not `dropSpec` a complete `？` original (`OfficialArabicDotTitleIncomplete(piece)`). A hole `4.` without `1.` or `8.` then `15.` is a dropped question (`SalvageSequenceGaps`, ArabicDot jump up to 8). Missing `1.` before later `（1）` / `二、`: salvage window starts at `一、`, not at `（4）`. Missing `19.`–`22.` after last kept `18.`: trailing gap, and do not CID-drop last pages past `CidGarbageOcrFrontPageCap` (short 公文 OCR every page). Nest `（一）` under the preceding `1.` when that is the GB 问答 shape; nest `（1）` **only** under a preceding `1.`/`2.`/`3.` (`RelayoutOfficialArabicListLevels` drops orphan `（1）` under bare `（一）`). A restart of `1.` under the next `一、` is still the common outline. Cover `印发《…综` + `合方案…》的通知` is one title (`ShouldMergeOfficialDocTitleWrap`); unclosed `《` and wrap tail `合方案…通知` are not a complete front title.

17. Multi-doc 规章 PDF: a clearly larger 办法/规定/细则 title above `第一章` is a document root (`CollectOfficialTitlesAboveChapter`). Nest that doc’s `第N章` / `附件` under it until the next such title; do not leave a second `第一章` as a sibling of the covering letter’s chapters. Font: title ≫ chapter (`minFont` from chapter/一、 spine). Cover `印发《A》…《B》的通知` quoting A/B (even with mashed 《》) does not count as already having A/B (`OfficialFlatIsCoverLetterQuotingDoc`). Keep `关于印发《方案》的通知` as the first bookmark; do not rewrite it to the inner 方案. Drop a later bare 方案 of that issued name (`OfficialIssuedDocTitleFromCover`); keep 办法/规定 that start a `第N章` spine. The 通知 / `中共…关于…意见` / basename is the TOC root; `一、` `二、` nest under it (`CollectMainOfficialDocTitle`, `OfficialDocTitleFromFileName`) even when the title is on page 1 and `一、` is on page 3, or OCR reports body-sized type. A 3-line 意见 (`中共江西省委 江西省人民政府` / `关于…` / `“一号改革工程”的意见`) is one title — do not drop the issuer line as 红头 (`OfficialTitleIsIssuerBanner`) or glue the `(2022年1月30日)` date. TOC display then drops the 发文单位 (`StripOfficialIssuerPrefixInPlace`) so the sidebar starts at `关于` / `印发` / `转发`; do not strip `关于征求《江西省人民政府…》` (already starts with `关于`) or a 办法 title with no subject marker. 红头 `…厅…领导小组办公室` is letterhead (`LooksLikeOfficialHongtouLetterhead`) — do not glue it onto `关于印发…的通知`. CID `关千` / `坏境` / `［程` is that same title (`RewriteOfficialTitleOcr`); basename `…意见（OA）` is still complete (`OfficialHanComplete` strips the trailing paren). Do not salvage unmarked `和自我革新相结合、` as `1.` (`OfficialLineLooksLikeConjunctionBodyWrap`). Do not glue `根据《…》制定本方案` onto `…实施方案`; drop wrap tails with `制定本方案` / `的部署要求` (`LooksLikeOfficialDocPreamble`). Body wrap `1.和自我革新相结合、` is not a heading (`OfficialArabicDotLooksLikeBodyWrap`). Prefer large/bold 方案 titles (`OfficialTitleHasDocSuffix`). `…办法（试行）` still has doc suffix 办法 after stripping the paren. Form-page ornaments `g` / `&` above `…汇总表` are not TOC titles (`StripOfficialTitleLeadingOrnament`, `DropOfficialDuplicateFormTitleSiblings`); do not treat `…表` form names as multi-doc roots. After Relayout lifts `附件N` beside `第N章`, a bare `公务员…汇总表` left under `附则` is the same sheet (`DropOfficialDuplicateFormTitleSiblings` walks that 办法’s 附件, not only previous siblings). Each 办法 keeps its own `附件1/2/3` — do not merge 调任’s 附件3 with 转任’s.

18. `附件1-1` / `附件2-1` / `附件2-2` is one Appendix marker (`number` + `subNumber`), not `附件1` plus a `1-1.` child. Glue `附件1` + `1-1.标题` to `附件1-1 标题` (`ConsumeOfficialAttachSubNumber`, `RewriteOfficialAppendixCompoundTitle`). 函末 `附件： 1-1.标题` is that same item — rewrite to `附件1-1`, do not invent `附件1：1-1` (`ParseAppendixColonArabicList`, `RewriteAppendixColonListTitle`, `FillBareOfficialAppendixNumbers`). Do not merge `附件2-1` with `附件2-2`. Form-table cell OCR (`（二）投入经济性` / weak mash) is not a title; `附件N-M` plus the form name is enough (`LooksLikeOfficialAttachTableBodyTitle`).

Helpers: `KeepOfficialDunhaoSpine`, `KeepOfficialArabicListSpine`, `KeepOfficialChineseParenSpine`, `KeepOfficialFormTableSpine`, `LooksLikeOfficialTableNoiseTitle`, `RewriteAppendixColonListTitle`, `LooksLikeOfficialAppendixCiteFragment`, `ShouldMergeOfficialSeeAppendixWrap`, `ShouldMergeOfficialArabicDotTitleWrap`, `ShouldMergeOfficialDocTitleWrap`, `LooksLikeOfficialRegulationDocTitle`, `CollectOfficialTitlesAboveChapter`, `LooksLikeOfficialTiaoKuanCite`, `DedupOfficialOverlappingNumberedFlat`, `ScanLinesLookLikeCidFontGarbage`, `OfficialAttachLineIsOutlineSpine`, `FileNameHasOfficialKind`, `ConsumeOfficialAttachSubNumber`, `RewriteOfficialAppendixCompoundTitle`, `LooksLikeOfficialAttachTableBodyTitle`, `StripOfficialIssuerPrefixInPlace`, `LooksLikeOfficialHongtouLetterhead`, `LooksLikeOfficialCoverTitleFragment`, `MergeOfficialCoverAppendixWithRealHeading`. Cap/salvage twins of the same `1.` / `2.` line (`1.我省…为` vs longer) must collapse to one bookmark — do not force-keep every `number==1` when an ArabicDot spine is already open. Body wrap `第二条第` + `（二）款第2点规定执行` is a citation (`LooksLikeOfficialTiaoKuanCite`); do not keep or salvage it as `（二）`.
